VSmGSjlzxAoVFpHB_wK-q5qgpnz1nlvlkgjgVw&oe=6B0DCDFD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer cover image 2560x1440 - Copy.png", "id": "2117929769014258", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619668_2117929772347591_7305990331590425037_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nx6Bz0Z2nKwQ7kNvwEksEDf&_nc_oc=AdqW10PrliyjmDnIcwBrT2RqIvZbMhUwFvAy1izsX57-6aMc7RxAtSMQL3EWYvUA6iY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSz1UcBlFNvfUYEJFrVYpUTm_Ii2tH6Gjs4tMJ4oEi83g&oe=6B0DAD71"}, "display_name": "Crystal Conquest", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Crystal Conquest is a **Free-To-Play** VR game where you **control the elements** and battle for victory. Harness the power of fire, water, earth, and air in epic 3v3 MOBA-inspired combat or intense dueling modes! Team up with your friends against AI or choose to fight in PvP!\n\n**Build your mage:** Choose the class that matches your playstyle and elements. Unlock class variants as you grow and customize your build. \n\n**Harness the elements:** Battle with elemental magic where each element has unique properties. Use earth, fire, water, and wind to block, dodge, and deflect your enemy's attacks. \n\n**Grow in Power:** Level up and unlock even more epic spells that change how you control the elements.\n\n**Choose Your Battle Mode:** Battle in 3v3 matches to capture crystals and topple towers, face off in duels, or team up in co-op to take on waves of AI. All modes support AI for solo or practice play.", "short_description": "Crystal Conquest is a free-to-play VR game where you control the elements and battle for victory. Harness the power of fire, water, earth, and air in epic 3v3 MOBA-inspired combat or intense dueling modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.mysticinteractive.com/s/MYSTIC-INTERACTIVE-PRIVACY-POLICY.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.mysticinteractive.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Mystic Interactive", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/KV9f2dwTdY", "website_url": "https://www.crystalconquest.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "25649479581303286"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1566552014526318"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1566552014526318"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1765526400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1566552014526318"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29740623598855510", "version": "1.2.2"}, "id": "25740082985581976", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25080401538211096", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29740623598855510"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "25740082985581976"}]}, "change_log": "New Features\n\u2022\tAdded 4 new rare primary spells: Dancing Flames, Shockwave, Ripple Orb, Volley\n\u2022\tAdded 4 new common basic spells unlocked by quests: Flash, Shards, Icy Splash, Gust\n\u2022\tAdded a Knockback mechanic and added it to Shockwave and Gust\n\nBalancing Changes\n\u2022\tKaelar\u2019s Prison now deals no damage\n\u2022\tLink spells can now be blocked. You can block enemy healing too\n\u2022\tInkflare changes: Added a barehand blocking ability while active, reduced damage reduction by half, and doubled the duration too\n\u2022\tReduced Burning Embers cooldown to 10 seconds\n\nBug Fixes and Improvements\n\u2022\tImproved game launch time and the loading skybox now shows at launch\n\u2022\tFixed a dashing bug where you couldn\u2019t dash while moving your head\n\u2022\tAdded new dash/teleport input options in the settings\n\u2022\tAdded shadow ovals at character feet on low quality settings\n\u2022\tAdded a new standing height calibration option which can help shorter or taller players\n\u2022\tFixed issues with the Geomancer being unable to move through the practice area portal\n\u2022\tFixed critical errors that could affect playtesters who tried a newer build and then reverted to an older build\n\u2022\tIt\u2019s now easier to slam the Earth Hammer into the ground\n\u2022\tAdded shadows around character feet", "created_date": 1795656719, "id": "29740623598855510", "version": "1.2.2", "version_code": 80, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25080401538211096", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29740623598855510"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1795301049, "id": "29690295783888292", "version": "1.2.2", "version_code": 79,